{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u>About Ritter &amp; Rotwein</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The past is red. And some Knights recalling it. Stories about the most glorious duels, sharp weapons, and even sharper minds. Always looking for wealth, sweet ladies, and the truth.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as ragdoll-knights with different weapons and armor sets out of the 15th century.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn to control the physical character and his weird behavior. (Jump and run, dodge, climb, fight)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The combat is dynamic, it depends on the weapon choice, the weight of the characters, and your armor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal is to get through the individual levels alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can heal by drinking wine, which grants a temporary malus on the character\u00b4s stability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Campaign:\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create an individual knight and find the fastest and most honorable way through the increasingly difficult levels.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prove yourself in the knightly virtues to collect honor and become the most honorable knight among all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994200/extras/bd945f0f5cf8288e08750173cc7b9959.poster.avif?t=1771865834\" width=824 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994200/extras/bd945f0f5cf8288e08750173cc7b9959.webm?t=1771865834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994200/extras/bd945f0f5cf8288e08750173cc7b9959.mp4?t=1771865834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>PVP: </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your weapons and armor, and defeat your former best friends in local multiplayer or Steam remote play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994200/extras/e352d31a3618ff2cac225a4418ae0abb.poster.avif?t=1771865834\" width=824 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994200/extras/e352d31a3618ff2cac225a4418ae0abb.webm?t=1771865834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994200/extras/e352d31a3618ff2cac225a4418ae0abb.mp4?t=1771865834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2994200?t=1771865834","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2994200?t=1771865834","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994200/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771865834","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994200/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771865834","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam